msgstr "私が脱出ポッドまで案内します。\\nついて来て下さい。\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_040"
msgid ""
"You can't make accusations like that without evidence.\\n I assume that you "
"have some?\\n"
msgstr "証拠も無く他人は告発できないよ。\\n何か証拠は持っているのかね？\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_041"
msgid ""
"This is a recording of a meeting between \\nTrent and the other "
"conspirators.\\n"
msgstr "これはトレントとその一味が、\\nシカゴで行ったミーティングの記録です。\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_042"
msgid "Seems overwhelming... I'm in your hands. \\nWhat do we do now?\\n"
msgstr "何ということだ…　よし、事態は了解した。\\nどうすればいいのかね？\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_043"
msgid "Hey, that's not...\\n"
msgstr "おい、ここは…\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_044"
msgid "It's an intruder...\\n"
msgstr "侵入者だ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_045"
msgid "How the hell did you get on board?\\n"
msgstr "一体どうやってこの飛行機に乗りこんだんだ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_046"
msgid "Now, let's retrieve the evidence.\\n"
msgstr "さあ、例の証拠品を回収しなくちゃね…\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_047"
msgid "The President's room is on this \\nlevel, Joanna.\\n"
msgstr "ジョアンナ、大統領はそのフロアーだ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_RIT_048"
